Damien is the name given by the voice that speaks over the loudspeakers of [[Geography/Althane/The Hollow/Lava Ruin|the lava ruin]], watching whoever enters through the ruin's cameras. He warns them off the heat and tells them how the ruin's gates are worked, and he speaks of the suited workers as the workers, who cannot work the valves themselves. His accent is not [[Geography/Althane/Oresk/index|Oreskian]], and he says only that he comes from north of the ruin. The name [[Geography/Althane/Athrea/Noxfell|Noxfell]] sounded familiar to him when it was read aloud, though he did not think it was quite the name he knew.

He says he is human and claims ten fingers. He asks visitors to open the one door the cameras cannot see past, since he believes he is in the room beyond it. Whether he is telling the truth about what he is has not been settled.
